        "fix_sketch": "Two layers, both needed. (1) Binding: add `--quorum-run-id`/`--quorum-prog-hash` to `run`, add `prog_hash` to VoteResponse, and have `collect_responses` (or a new filter at the call site) DROP any vote whose run_id or prog_hash mismatches, counting and reporting the drops; a directory containing votes for other run-ids should be an error, not silently ignored. (2) Authentication: add a `signature` field to VoteResponse, sign the canonical (voter_tcb, run_id, prog_hash, approved) form with a per-voter key bound to that voter's attested TCB, and verify at the io boundary before any vote reaches check_quorum. Derive lineage_root from the verified key, never from the vote body. Also fix the vsock TCP-loopback stand-in's lack of peer auth (quorum/vsock.rs:33-37).",
