        "fix_sketch": "Invert every default in mmds.rs: absent key, non-array value, decode failure, boot_params==0, missing axon.policy=, and !POLICY_READY must all yield `EffectSet(0)`, and the kernel must refuse to run the program (violation_exit) rather than proceed with an empty set silently. Change the static default from 0xFF to 0. Separately, make axon-vm refuse to launch when allowed_effects is None instead of serializing `null` (main.rs, the mmds payload builder). Harden the scan: require the key at object depth 1 and reject duplicate keys rather than taking the first match. Add boot tests for each error path asserting 0 bits allowed.",
