        "fix_sketch": "At the top of __axon_ai_complete (lib.rs:~250), add `if prompt_ptr.is_null() || prompt_len < 0 { unsafe { write_err_out(\"ai_complete: invalid prompt pointer/length\", out_len, out_ptr) }; return; }`, mirroring the extract bridges. Consider also replacing from_utf8_unchecked with a checked conversion in the same pass.",
