        "fix_sketch": "Provenance: cap the in-memory store as a ring buffer (the JSONL file already holds full history) and index by fn_name in a HashMap<String, Vec<Record>> so best_input_for/provenance_records_for stop doing O(n) full scans. Select: replace the 100us spin with Condvar-based waiting on the channels, and either document the advisory-readiness caveat at the call site or return a value already dequeued. Both are optimizations — schedule only when a long-running native optimizer loop or multi-consumer channels become a real workload.",
